flowchart TD
    Alert[Security Alert Triggered] --> Triage[Determine Incident Severity Level SEV1-4]
    Triage --> Runbook[Execute Target Incident Runbook]
    Runbook --> Containment[Apply Immediate Threat Containment]
    Containment --> Recovery[Restore System Services & Rotate Secrets]
    Recovery --> PostMortem[Archive Findings & Conduct 48h Post-Mortem]
